# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:18
translate chinese barmenu_14e36cbe:

    # "[rik] and I hangout for a few hours. I end up getting roped into joining her on the Arcadia track field tomorrow."
    "我和[rik]一起呆了一会儿，她突然提到明天要带我去Arcadia体育场玩一玩。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:23
translate chinese barmenu_4978a506:

    # sky "You called, and I'm here! How's it hanging?"
    sky "呼呀~，我来了！最近怎么样？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:27
translate chinese barmenu_05bf500a:

    # rik "It's nice to have genuine friends to hang out with again."
    rik "又能和真心朋友一起玩的感觉真好。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:31
translate chinese barmenu_926914b0:

    # rik "You two go off on your own for a while, I'm going to chat with an old friend over in the corner there."
    rik "你们俩先聊，我去找那个老朋友叙叙旧。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:32
translate chinese barmenu_7015cea5:

    # sky "Alright, let's go to the pavilion. Should be a bit quieter."
    sky "好了，咱去后院吧。那儿应该能清静点儿。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:39
translate chinese barmenu_e5018343:

    # sky "Great talk! Fancy another drink?"
    sky "呼，感觉不错，再来一杯？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:52
translate chinese barmenu_d6cb1c3e:

    # rik "Want to take our conversation outside?"
    rik "要不我们出去聊聊？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:54
translate chinese barmenu_9c1edacd:

    # sky "Don't mind if I stay here for a bit? One of my gym buddies just came in."
    sky "不介意我在这儿呆一会儿吧？我有个健身的朋友要来。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:62
translate chinese barmenu_90a97e38:

    # rik "What a lovely evening. Shall we head back inside for another round?"
    rik "多美的夜晚啊。要不回去再来一次？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:101
translate chinese baromenu_76673cb6:

    # rik "Heading back to [sky]'s place? I'll leave you two lovebirds to it~"
    rik "要回[sky]那儿吗？那我就不打扰二位雅兴了——"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:105
translate chinese baromenu_76673cb6_1:

    # rik "Heading back to [sky]'s place? I'll leave you two lovebirds to it~"
    rik "要回[sky]那儿吗？那我就不打扰二位雅兴了——"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:117
translate chinese baromenu_60cee5c3:

    # "Earlier that night..."
    "那晚早些时候......"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:121
translate chinese baromenu_ff5085e3:

    # rik "With that beauty? I wouldn't mind that at all."
    rik "和那位美丽的女士？我可不会介意。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:164
translate chinese bar1_91cd072c:

    # "Tonight is the perfect night to search for [rik]. I just got a message from [pen]: ‘I heard [rik] frequents The Riding Mare. Quite a fuss for a celebrity to be in a small place like that. She’s still a big deal.’"
    "今晚是个去找[rik]的好时候。我刚收到了一条来自[pen]的消息：“我听说[rik]经常光顾一家叫‘骑驹’的酒吧。听说她这样的有名气的马出现在这种地方时还引起过不小的骚动，看来她还没有过气嘛。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:165
translate chinese bar1_6b4877c9:

    # "I read the text with a faint smile. The Riding Mare is the bar that 'my' [rik] owned."
    "我看完信息，微微一笑。“骑驹”是“我的”[rik]开的酒吧。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:166
translate chinese bar1_99ebaad3:

    # "A striking coincidence. Maybe it’s the old-fashioned style of the bar that entices her in, even across the boundaries of universes."
    "真巧啊。也许是那种酒吧的复古风格吸引了她，甚至跨越了宇宙的限制。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:167
translate chinese bar1_1341d15d:

    # "I grab my bag and head out."
    "我拎着包就走了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:182
translate chinese bar1_c51ca02e:

    # "The streets are eerily quiet on the way, save for a distance rumble that grows louder with each step. Another earthquake, brief but unsettling."
    "路上的街道异常安静，只有远处传来一阵隆隆声，每走一步，那声音就愈发响亮。大地也传来震动，虽短暂却令人不安。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:183
translate chinese bar1_1eb4aac8:

    # "I steady myself, the vibrations feel like an omen, the kind of premonition you can’t ignore…"
    "我站稳脚跟，那震动感觉像是一种预兆，一种你无法忽视的预感…..."

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:185
translate chinese bar1_6ea06505:

    # "And yet, I find myself like many other passersby ignoring it. I’ve already gotten used to the frequent earthquakes, but I still have this gnawing feeling that there’s something unusual about them."
    "然而，我发现自己已和其他的许多路马一样无视了这震动。我已经习惯了频繁的地震，但仍有一种莫名的感觉折磨着我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:187
translate chinese bar1_13af841a:

    # "I arrive at The Riding Mare, the neon sign flickering like a dying star. The place looks either looks like it’s been waiting for me, or it’s just the kind of place that never changes."
    "我来到“骑驹”，霓虹标牌如同垂死的星星一样闪烁着。这个地方似乎正静待着我的到来，亦或者它只是从来不曾改变罢了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:189
translate chinese bar1_6a7baa3f:

    # "The bartender, a grizzled old mare with eyes like embers, watches me come in with a curiosity towards my unusual appearance but quickly it’s overshadowed by indifference."
    "酒保是一只头发花白的老母马，双眸如同燃烧着的余烬，她看着我进来，起初对我不同寻常的外表很好奇，但很快就被冷漠所掩盖了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:190
translate chinese bar1_17fea93f:

    # "I take note of the others at the bar. About ten people currently, and none of them are [rik]. I approach the counter, and the bartender looks up."
    "我观察了一下酒吧里的顾客。现在大概有十匹马，但没见到[rik]。我走近吧台，酒保抬头看着我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:191
translate chinese bar1_d76e6c7b:

    # mc "I heard [rik] was here earlier. Can you tell me where she went?"
    mc "我听说[rik]早些时候来过这里。你能告诉我她去哪了吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:193
translate chinese bar1_1335a748:

    # misc "She was here, all right, and kicked up quite a fuss. Didn’t leave no address or nothing if that’s what you’re expecting. Just up and vanished."
    misc "好吧，她是来过。就这么突然离开了，还闹得沸沸扬扬得。没有留下地址或其它什么——如果你想要的话。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:194
translate chinese bar1_b34a3ac5:

    # misc "Heavy drinker, that one. Some folks say she’s gone off the rails. Wasn’t pretty."
    misc "那家伙现在是个酒鬼。马们都说她现在已经不复当年了。过得可不太好啊。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:195
translate chinese bar1_da79168b:

    # "She wipes a glass with a rag, the movements so practiced and detached that she does it perfectly without breaking eye contact."
    "她用布擦着杯子，动作熟练得毫无感情，以至于完全没有打断我们之间的眼神交流。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:196
translate chinese bar1_85f212f3:

    # "I look around and catch snippets of conversation from the patrons scattered about."
    "我环顾四周，捕捉着顾客们的只言片语。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:200
translate chinese bar1_2c3a67a2:

    # misc "[rik]? Man, she was something back in the day. Used to be the pride of the city when the sports was on. It’s a shame."
    misc "[rik]？哦，她以前真了不起。那时还有体育比赛呢，她可是这座城市的骄傲。可惜了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:202
translate chinese bar1_c3e3d083:

    # misc "Shame? She’s just a drunk. City’s changed. No more games, no more fun. Only the military and the dark lands."
    misc "可惜？她现在只是个酒鬼。这座城市变了。不再有比赛，不再有娱乐。只有皇家卫队和黑暗之地。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:203
translate chinese bar1_67a5b23c:

    # misc "[rik]’s just another washed-up name."
    misc "[rik]吗？又一个过时的名字。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:204
translate chinese bar1_65636cfa:

    # "Their words drift to me, a testament to a time long past. To a city that has fallen into the hands of those who value power over pleasure, structure over spirit."
    "他们的言语在我耳边飘荡，仿佛是对一个久远年代的见证。这座城市已经落入那些重权力轻享乐、重结构轻精神的人手中了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:205
translate chinese bar1_0ef678a2:

    # "[rik], once a beacon of athletic prowess, already reduced to a relic of the past."
    "[rik]曾经是一名明星运动员，现在已经沦为过去的遗迹。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:209
translate chinese bar1_d4b5b40f:

    # misc "You think you know [rik]? You don’t know a damn thing about her!"
    misc "你以为你很了解[rik]？你对她一无所知！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:210
translate chinese bar1_86c331f7:

    # "I turn to see an orange mare standing not too far from me, her violet eyes blazing with intensity. She’s young, with an air of defiance."
    "我转过身，看到一只橙色的雌驹站在离我不远的地方，紫罗兰色的眼睛炯炯有神。她很年轻，带着一股不服输的气势。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:211
translate chinese bar1_4253b3a8:

    # "The other patrons give her an uninterested glance and return to their drinks, somehow making me the target of this orange mare’s wrath by process of elimination."
    "其他顾客漠不关心地瞥了她一眼，便接着继续喝酒，不知怎么的，我成了这只橙色雌驹倾泻怒火的目标。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:213
translate chinese bar1_b6467901:

    # misc "[rik] works harder in a day than any of us have worked our entire lives! She’s a legend. I can’t stand people acting like she’s just a washed-up-has-been!"
    misc "[rik]的一天比我们任何马一辈子都努力！她是个传奇，我不能容忍你们把她当作一个失败者！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:214
translate chinese bar1_4e425679:

    # mc "I didn’t mean any disrespect. I’m just an old friend trying to find her."
    mc "我没有任何不尊重的意思，我只是一个想找她的老朋友。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:216
translate chinese bar1_84219eeb:

    # "Her eyes quickly soften, and she extends a fuzzy hand."
    "她的眼神立刻温和了下来，并向我伸出了一只毛茸茸的手。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:217
translate chinese bar1_95ba7775:

    # misc "Sorry, about that! My name’s…"
    misc "不好意思！我的名字是......"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:228
translate chinese bar1_a40bf30c:

    # "Her anger seemed to melt away as fast as it appeared. Although it was replaced by a weariness etched into her features. She takes a seat on the barstool beside me."
    "她的愤怒似乎迅速消散了，尽管取而代之的是她脸上的疲惫的神情。她在我身边的吧台椅上坐下。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:229
translate chinese bar1_97cfeb05:

    # sky "Yeah, things have changed… The golden age of her career. She was {i}the{/i} top athlete, that time was tragically cut short by some darkness nonsense."
    sky "是啊，世道变了......在她职业生涯的黄金时代，她是最{i}顶尖{/i}的运动员，而那段时光却因为一些黑暗的胡言乱语而不幸夭折。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:230
translate chinese bar1_9a269425:

    # sky "But this city’s got no room for sports anymore. Only thing keeping her afloat is the tabloids and endless drama."
    sky "但这座城市已经容纳不下体育运动了。唯一能维持她名气的只剩下小道消息和无休止的八卦新闻。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:231
translate chinese bar1_fd0a4308:

    # mc "How did you get to know her?"
    mc "你是怎么认识她的？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:233
translate chinese bar1_471a8c48:

    # "[sky]’s gaze drops to the bar top. She traces an absent pattern with her fingers, lost in thought."
    "[sky]的目光落在吧台上。她用手指描画着一个无形的图案，陷入了沉思。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:234
translate chinese bar1_afb0c9ae:

    # sky "I was her apprentice. She taught me everything I know."
    sky "我曾是她的学员，她教了我很多。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:235
translate chinese bar1_463908c0:

    # sky "Which means I’m equally shit out of luck because there’s nothing to train for. No competitions, no games. Just a world that’s moved on without us."
    sky "这意味着我也一样倒霉了，因为很快没有什么训练的必要了。没有竞技，没有比赛。世界依然在运转，只是没有了我们的位置。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:236
translate chinese bar1_dfad799d:

    # sky "If competitions ever do start again, we’ll probably be past our prime."
    sky "也许有一天体育比赛会重新回到社会中来，但那时我估计我们早就退休了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:237
translate chinese bar1_044420e6:

    # "This universe has taken so much from its people, left them scrambling to find meaning in a landscape that’s become increasingly hostile and indifferent."
    "这个世界夺走了他们太多的东西，让他们在一个变得越来越恶意和冷漠的环境中苦苦寻找着生活意义。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:238
translate chinese bar1_bbec5fb4:

    # mc "I know what it’s like to feel like you don’t quite belong. Maybe that’s why I’m here. Trying to find something that makes sense."
    mc "我了解这种格格不入的感觉。或许这就是我在这里的原因，试图寻找一些有意义的东西。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:240
translate chinese bar1_1acc1ac7:

    # sky "[rik] always said there’s kinship between those who have lost but keep trying…"
    sky "[rik]常常说那些在失落中苦苦挣扎的人们总是惺惺相惜......"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:242
translate chinese bar1_faa3916a:

    # sky "Which is exactly why I’m so pissed off!"
    sky "这正是我如此生气的原因！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:243
translate chinese bar1_e4c4b2af:

    # mc "Huh?!"
    mc "口舍？！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:245
translate chinese bar1_8ef8104c:

    # sky "[rik]’s given up! Just like that. Everything she worked for, everything she was… gone."
    sky "[rik]就这么放弃了！她为之奋斗的一切，她的一切......都不在了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:247
translate chinese bar1_fdaaa2ca:

    # sky "Just drowning in drink and self-pity. it’s like she’s forgotten what it means to fight, to actually live. There’s more to life than fame and trophies. Hell, there’s more to life than what this city’s become!"
    sky "只是沉溺于酗酒和自怨自艾之中，她就好像忘记了奋斗和生活的意义，生活不只有名利和奖杯。该死，比起这座城市的现状，生活才更有意义！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:248
translate chinese bar1_d2f6b7f6:

    # "I can see the struggle in her eyes, the deep anger at watching someone she admires lose their way."
    "我能看到她的眼神里的抗争，以及看着自己的偶像迷失方向时深深的愤怒。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:249
translate chinese bar1_1693cd4b:

    # mc "You’re right. Losing your purpose, having it ripped away even – that’s a heavy blow. But giving up? That’s the easy way out."
    mc "你说得对。失去，甚至被人夺走生活的目标——这是沉重的打击。但放弃呢？不过是最轻松的出路罢了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:250
translate chinese bar1_f272d7d0:

    # mc "If she’s willing to fight, there’s a chance to reclaim what she wants. Failing that, maybe there’s a chance to make a difference, to find new meaning."
    mc "如果她愿意抗争，就有机会夺回她想要的东西。即使做不到这一点，也许还有机会有所作为，找到新的意义。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:255
translate chinese bar1_c90b5a2b:

    # "[sky] leans in close, a spark of hope in her eyes. This actually breaks me out of my concentration as I realize just how cute she looks."
    "[sky]靠近我，眼中闪烁着希望的火花。这让我从专注中回过神来，因为我意识到她看起来是多么可爱。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:257
translate chinese bar1_d01da614:

    # sky "You get it! Hehe!"
    sky "就是就是！嘿嘿！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:258
translate chinese bar1_8f4c4436:

    # "The city outside may be lacking hope, but if I can get [rik] to join the Virtues, a team capable of potentially confronting the darkness that has tainted this world. It’s a chance not only for glory, but to return to her previous life."
    "外面的城市或许缺少希望，但如果我能让[rik]加入谐律的队伍，一个有能力对抗这腐化着世界的黑暗的团队。这不仅是一个荣耀的机会，也是一个能让她重返曾经生活的契机。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:259
translate chinese bar1_079350be:

    # mc "There’s a group called the Virtues. Six powerful mares that are going to work under the Queen, and I’m hoping that in collaboration, they’ll be able to fight the darkness."
    mc "有一支叫“谐律”的团队——六只出色的雌驹将在女王麾下效力，我相信在她们的通力合作下足以对抗黑暗。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:260
translate chinese bar1_4d678f6a:

    # mc "It might be the very thing she needs to pull herself up, a new purpose. If she’s willing to fight, if she’s willing to take that chance, there’s a place for her."
    mc "这可能是令她振作起来所需要的东西，一个新的目标。如果她愿意抗争，如果她愿意把握住这次机会，团队就会有她的一席之地。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:262
translate chinese bar1_971e5186:

    # "[sky]’s eyes widen as she takes in the idea. The prospect of a new purpose, a new battle. It seems to resonate with her, but she’s caught between excitement and scepticism"
    "[sky]的眼睛睁得大大的，显然她接受了这个想法。新的目标与奋斗的前景似乎引起了她的共鸣。但她在兴奋之余不免有些疑虑。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:264
translate chinese bar1_8eb5f127:

    # sky "Hm… It’s exactly what she needs, and what she wants. It sounds too good to be true."
    sky "嗯......这可太好了。这正是她需要的，也是她想要的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:265
translate chinese bar1_2fbad4d9:

    # sky "If the darkness is gone, not only will she be heralded as a hero, but she can continue her glory days as an athlete."
    sky "如果黑暗消失了，她不仅会被誉为英雄，还能继续她作为运动员的光辉岁月。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:266
translate chinese bar1_578191ea:

    # "She pauses, taking a moment to gather her thoughts, then continues with a note of hesitation."
    "她停顿了一下，整理了一会儿思绪，然后带着一丝犹豫继续说道。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:268
translate chinese bar1_b82cbe16:

    # sky "I was actually with [rik] here up until about half an hour ago. We didn’t part on the best of terms. She went home after a bit of a fight. But it’s not unusual for us to meet up for drinks. Perhaps the three of us could organize a meeting here."
    sky "事实上，直到半小时前我还和[rik]在一起。我们这次沟通得不太顺利，她小吵了一架就回家了，但我们在一起喝酒是常有的事。也许我们三个可以在这里坐下来聊聊。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:269
translate chinese bar1_5755ad80:

    # mc "That sounds like a good plan. We’ll meet up, talk things over. If [rik]’s willing to listen, this’ll be a huge opportunity for her, rather than another dead end."
    mc "听起来是个好计划，我们应该见个面，好好谈谈。如果[rik]愿意听，这对她来说将是一个重要的机会，而不是另一条死胡同。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:271
translate chinese bar1_67cdcffc:

    # "With a wide grin, she reaches across the bar with a burst of energy and eagerly orders a drink for both of us without even asking."
    "她咧嘴一笑，兴冲冲地穿过吧台，连问都没问就迫不及待地为我们俩各自点了一杯酒。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:272
translate chinese bar1_5f71943f:

    # sky "You know, I’m really glad we ran into each other. It’s not every day someone comes along and actually gives a damn."
    sky "你知道吗，我真的很高兴我们能相遇，并不是每天都会有马来关心我们的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:274
translate chinese bar1_e53ec1c1:

    # sky "Here’s to new beginnings!"
    sky "为新的开始干杯！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:277
translate chinese bar1_f4323b83:

    # "She slides the glass across to me and I happily accept it. We toast, and as the night wears on, the conversation flows as easily as the booze."
    "她把酒杯递给我，我欣然接受。我们干了一杯，随着夜幕降临，我们之间的交谈就如同杯中美酒一般轻松流畅。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:278
translate chinese bar1_0241a164:

    # "[sky], with her vibrant energy, and tomboy charm, becomes the focus of my thoughts. She talks with a frankness that’s both refreshing and rare, her laughter ringing clear and unburdened."
    "[sky]充满了活力，她那假小子的魅力令她成为我思绪的焦点。她的谈吐坦率，令人耳目一新，她的笑声清脆响亮，无忧无虑。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:287
translate chinese bar1_599a3a4d:

    # sky "So, what brought you to this part of town? I haven’t seen anyone quite like you around here."
    sky "那么，你怎么会来这里？我还没见过像你这样的“人”呢！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:288
translate chinese bar1_cc08c52b:

    # mc "I’m just trying to make sense of things."
    mc "我只是想让一切都回到正轨。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:289
translate chinese bar1_56ec2aa3:

    # mc "I heard [rik] likes coming here, and it seemed like a thread worth following. And it seems like I ended up in good company."
    mc "我听说[rik]喜欢来这里，似乎是一个值得关注的线索。看来，最后我还是找到好团伙了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:291
translate chinese bar1_68be64c8:

    # sky "Good company, huh? I suppose you’re not just talking about the drink."
    sky "好团伙？哈？你应该指的不是所谓“饭醉团伙”吧。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:292
translate chinese bar1_1e0ea837:

    # "Her playful tone was accompanied by a slight tilt of her head. I catch her gaze, her smile instantly widening as I do."
    "她摇头晃脑，说着俏皮话。当四目相对的那一刻，我俩都哈哈大笑起来。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:293
translate chinese bar1_9d6342e5:

    # mc "{i}Definitely{/i} not just the drink. It’s always great to meet someone that’s willing to speak their mind and actually listen."
    mc "{i}绝对{/i}不只是喝酒啦。能遇到一个愿意说出自己想法并真正倾听的人总是很棒的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:295
translate chinese bar1_0349e8a2:

    # sky "Bahaha. Unfortunately, that's not very common in my industry! Everyone else’d only talk about the ‘old sports days.’"
    sky "哈哈哈。很不幸，这在我们这行里可不常见！那些马只会谈论“旧体育时代”。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:296
translate chinese bar1_5aa0045f:

    # mc "But instead of wallowing in the past, you’re looking for a way forward. You surprised me."
    mc "但你没有沉湎于过去，而是继续寻找前进的方向。你让我很惊讶呢。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:298
translate chinese bar1_85e51b02:

    # sky "Well, I suppose I have a way of doing that. Sometimes, it’s easier to put up a front than to deal with what’s underneath."
    sky "嗯，或许我这样做也不是不行。有时候，装装样子总比来真的要容易得多。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:299
translate chinese bar1_2a676c6c:

    # "She looks down at her drink, the reflection of the bar’s light shimmering on the surface."
    "她低头看着自己杯中的酒，酒吧的灯光在酒面上反射出浮光。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:300
translate chinese bar1_c869d80c:

    # mc "We all wear masks, don’t we? It’s the genuine moments that cut through."
    mc "我们都戴着面具，不是吗？不过，真诚的时刻才是最重要的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:302
translate chinese bar1_ac0fb2f6:

    # sky "You’re right about that. We’re all suffering. But it’s rare to find someone that sees through the façade and still wants to stick around."
    sky "你说得没错，我们都有自己的难处，但很少有马能在看穿我们伪装的同时，还愿意留在我们身边。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:303
translate chinese bar1_ab9f093a:

    # sky "I’ve had this exact conversation at least ten times before, but I’ve never had anyone actually interested in helping."
    sky "像这样的对话我以前至少有过十次，但从来没有马真正有兴趣帮我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:305
translate chinese bar1_d82b9dfb:

    # sky "It’s always ‘Damn, I hope things get better!’, or even people trying to give me reasons for why I should actually give up."
    sky "马们总是说“淦，我希望事情会变得更好！”，甚至有马试图为我找一些理由，告诉我为什么应该放弃。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:306
translate chinese bar1_3c0ec5a1:

    # sky "And it’s not like I’m asking for a magical opportunity like the one you’re giving [rik]. I just wanted a little thought and support."
    sky "而且，我也不是奢求像你给[rik]那样的神奇机会，我只是想要一点想法和支持。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:308
translate chinese bar1_18acce54:

    # sky "Makes me wonder, has [rik] had this conversation ten times before too? I think [rik] was let down too many times, and just gave up."
    sky "我就在想：[rik]之前是不是也有过好几次这样的对话？我觉得[rik]被辜负的次数太多了，所以才会放弃。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:309
translate chinese bar1_c0ae09f0:

    # mc "But [rik] had you, and I can tell that you never gave up. Not on her, not on yourself."
    mc "但现在[rik]有你，我看得出你不会放弃。不会放弃她，也不会放弃你自己。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:311
translate chinese bar1_2fa09af3:

    # sky "I wonder if support is really enough… Maybe now is the time for action."
    sky "我不知道这些支持究竟够不够......也许现在是时候采取行动了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:313
translate chinese bar1_01278161:

    # sky "You know, I’ve met a lot of people in my time. Most of them are either full of themselves or just out for a good time. But you—"
    sky "要知道，在这段时间我遇到过很多人，他们中的大多数不是自以为是就是只想寻欢作乐。但你——"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:315
translate chinese bar1_296cc5c9:

    # sky "—You seem different. There’s something refreshing about you. It’s rare to find someone who doesn’t just see me as a ‘former athlete’ or a ‘celebrity.’"
    sky "——你似乎不一样。你让我眼前一亮。能找到一个不只把我当成“前运动员”或“明星”的人，真是难得。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:316
translate chinese bar1_5ec71c77:

    # mc "Really? I didn’t even know you were famous."
    mc "真的吗？我都不知道你这么有名。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:318
translate chinese bar1_a789136c:

    # sky "Not as widely known as [rik], but yes, I was preparing to take the world by storm as another top flier, ‘full of potential’."
    sky "虽然不像[rik]那样广为人知，但没错，作为又一个的顶尖飞行者，我准备在这个世界掀起一场风暴，“动力拉满”的那种。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:320
translate chinese bar1_2e21014a:

    # "She gestures down to her toned body, and my eyes follow her hands as I soak in the detail. Although by the time my eyes return to her face, she’s smirking as if I wasn’t supposed to actually look."
    "她指了指自己健美的身材，我的视线跟随着她的手势欣赏着她的身姿。不过，当我的目光再回到她的脸上时，她却在傻笑，好像我不应该看似的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:321
translate chinese bar1_7be2680b:

    # mc "But even if I did know, I don’t think it’d make a difference. It’s easy to see beyond the labels when you’re talking to someone as real as you."
    mc "但即使我知道，我想也不会有什么影响。当你和一个像你一样真实的人面对面交谈时，就很容易看清标签之外的东西。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:323
translate chinese bar1_6a2a4323:

    # sky "Hehe, so, other than saving washed-up athletes from themselves, what do you do for fun?"
    sky "嘿嘿，那么，除了拯救落魄运动员之外，你还想做啥好玩的？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:324
translate chinese bar1_33ff4bb7:

    # mc "I’m not originally from Arcadia, so I love reading the books or really any media produced here. Even your non-fiction reads like fiction to me. Anything out of the ordinary is enough to captivate me."
    mc "我不是Arcadia本地人，所以我喜欢浏览这里的书籍或任何媒体。即使是你们的非虚构作品，我读起来也像小说。任何不寻常的东西都足以吸引我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:325
translate chinese bar1_6309044c:

    # "She rests her chin on her hand, her gaze fixed on me with a mixture of intrigue and amusement."
    "她用手托着下巴，目光紧盯着我，眼神中夹杂着好奇和欣喜。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:327
translate chinese bar1_a9522b22:

    # sky "Books, huh? That’s actually pretty cool. I have a soft spot for the fantastical too. When I was younger, I used to get lost in stories of heroic quests and legendary battles."
    sky "读书？嗯，确实挺有意思的。我对奇幻故事也情有独钟。小时候，我常常沉迷在英雄征途和传奇战役的故事里。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:329
translate chinese bar1_f970a214:

    # sky "For me, sports took over as a kind of reality where I could be that hero that tries their best to overcome impossible obstacles. At heart, I’m still a full-time nerd, I just focused that boundless energy."
    sky "对我来说，运动占据了我大部分的生活，在那里我可以成为竭尽全力战胜不可能的英雄。但在内心深处，我仍然始终是个书宅，只是我把大量的精力集中在运动上罢了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:330
translate chinese bar1_0af2d8fe:

    # sky "But I admit, the flying did take over, I don’t read or watch as many things as I used to."
    sky "但我承认，飞行确实在很大程度上占据了我的生活，我不再像以前那样阅读或观看那么多的东西。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:332
translate chinese bar1_e27291ed:

    # sky "I could use an extra hour or two every day, but then I don’t know if I’d even make use of it effectively."
    sky "我每天可以多花一两个小时，但我不知道我能不能有效地利用它。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:333
translate chinese bar1_2ac4f23b:

    # mc "Ahh, I know what you mean. there’s always so much to do, that sometimes life can pass you by without you even realizing."
    mc "啊，我懂你意思。总是有那么多事情要做，有时生活会在不知不觉中与你擦肩而过。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:335
translate chinese bar1_e6de8cdc:

    # sky "But it’s even worse for me, at times I’m just too tired or lazy to finish all the things I want to do."
    sky "但对我来说更糟糕的是，有时我实在太累或太懒，无法完成所有想做的事情。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:336
translate chinese bar1_2bb3db02:

    # sky "By the time I finally finish training, or work, sometimes I just want to switch my brain off and go comatose for the rest of the evening."
    sky "当我终于结束训练或工作时，有时我只想让大脑休息下，狠狠地睡他一个晚上。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:337
translate chinese bar1_8ce3c5fd:

    # mc "Now that is very relatable."
    mc "这倒是挺实在的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:339
translate chinese bar1_8e8f9806:

    # sky "Your turn, ask me some questions~"
    sky "该你了，来问点问题吧~"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:343
translate chinese b1m1_91e09233:

    # sky "I was a promising candidate at a sports college. I was essentially following the line of successes required to join the Storm Chasers."
    sky "我曾是体育学院里一位很有前途的学员，基本上沿着加入Storm Chasers所需的路子在走。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:345
translate chinese b1m1_13cc1ac6:

    # sky "To tell you the truth, I met [rik] when I was younger, and she gave me the push and inspiration to reach my potential. Once I did, she was waiting there to coach me, just like she promised."
    sky "说真的，当还小的那会儿我见过[rik]，她激励了我前进，引导我激发潜能。当我做到了，她就会像她承诺的，一直在那儿等着我，指导我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:347
translate chinese b1m1_2c18af91:

    # sky "Turns out we also made for great friends. She’s kind of like… an older sister to me. That’s why it hurts even more."
    sky "本来我们还成了非常要好的朋友。对于我来说......她就像姐姐一样。正因如此，现在才更让马难受。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:351
translate chinese b1m1_dc7ff0b7:

    # sky "I’m currently working in a gym as a personal trainer, I have a bit of an addiction to working out. Undoubtedly one of the better addictions I could have caught!"
    sky "目前我在一家健身房做私人教练，而且我对锻炼有点上瘾。不过，这已经是我能染上的较好的瘾了！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:353
translate chinese b1m1_9ae606e6:

    # sky "But other than that, you can catch me spending time together with my buddies. Usually at bars with a few too many drinks. But when the world is so weary, you need something to help you forget."
    sky "另外，你会看到我总和兄弟们待在一起。通常是在酒吧这儿，喝上几杯 —— 其实往往会喝得有点多。可这世界这么累，你总得找点什么来帮自己忘忧啊。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:355
translate chinese b1m1_145455f0:

    # sky "I guess I have one other way of relieving stress, maybe I’ll show you later, if you’re lucky~"
    sky "我想我还有另一种减压的办法，如果你运气好的话，或许之后会让你见识见识～"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:359
translate chinese b1m1_e947755d:

    # sky "I love it. I love the burn, the adrenaline, the thrill. I’d do all this even without the money and accolades."
    sky "我爱它。我就这种灼烧的感觉、肾上腺素飙升的亢奋，还有那份刺激感。即便没有金钱和荣誉，我也会全身心投入其中。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:361
translate chinese b1m1_f4e06755:

    # sky "But the people can be brutal. There’s a lot of petty playground politics in the pursuit of the top spot. People will quite happily push you down just so they can get a little higher."
    sky "但马心有时很残酷。为了爬到顶峰，到处都是些幼稚的勾心斗角。总有的会毫不顾忌地把你踩下去，只为了让自己能爬得稍高一点。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:363
translate chinese b1m1_d7dab604:

    # sky "I just try and focus on myself and my own goals, but somehow even that earns you a few haters."
    sky "我只是努力专注于自己和自己的目标，可不知怎么的，还是招来了一些讨厌我的家伙。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:364
translate chinese b1m1_0578159b:

    # mc "Some people really are just born haters, eh?"
    mc "总有的天生讨马嫌，不是吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:366
translate chinese b1m1_c65d6365:

    # sky "In a way, I’m almost fine with it. It lets you weed out the toxic personalities. What you really want to do is surround yourself with a positive group of like-minded athletes that can give you advice and push you to be your best."
    sky "从某种角度来说，我倒也无所谓。这能帮你剔除那些负能量的马。你真正该做的，是和一群积极向上、志同道合的运动员结伴，他们能给你建议，还能激励你做到最好。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:367
translate chinese b1m1_abdbf5eb:

    # mc "Agree with you there. I don’t know where I’d be without my friends."
    mc "是啊。真不知道要是没有朋友们，我会是什么样子。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:369
translate chinese b1m1_07623a0c:

    # sky "I also have to point out that the level of horny among top athletes is crazy. I’ve been invited to so many threesomes and orgies – which I refused, of course!"
    sky "我还得提一嘴，顶尖运动员里那种饥渴的程度简直离谱。我被邀请过太多次3P和淫趴了 —— 当然，我都拒绝了！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:370
translate chinese b1m1_25e83413:

    # mc "Actual {i}orgies{/i}?"
    mc "真的是{i}淫趴{/i}吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:372
translate chinese b1m1_785d3827:

    # sky "Yeah, seriously! Have you heard of the Velvet Triangle before? One of my previous teammates ended up taking a break because she got pregnant after a party there."
    sky "是啊，我认真的！你听说过 “Velvet Triangle” 吗？我之前有个队友在那儿参加派对后怀孕了，最后只好休赛了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:374
translate chinese b1m1_ffdc0b62:

    # sky "But thanks to [rik]'s 'coaching', I have the perfect strategy to avoid that~ {i}Wink{/i}"
    sky "不过多亏了[rik]的“教导”，我能完美地回避那些邀请~{i}（眨眼）{/i}"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:375
translate chinese b1m1_81709362:

    # mc "You do?"
    mc "真的？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:377
translate chinese b1m1_c000cf25:

    # sky "Oh, uh… Hehe, it’s nothing!"
    sky "哦， 额......哈哈，没什么！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:378
translate chinese b1m1_433fc8af:

    # "It’s totally butt stuff."
    "说白了就是些屁事而已。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:383
translate chinese b1m1_c5c3b994:

    # sky "Oh, and I also really wanted to learn an instrument!"
    sky "哦对了，我还特别想学一个乐器！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:385
translate chinese b1m1_cb9239cb:

    # sky "Can you believe I bought a guitar that I can’t even play? I said I was going to practice for half an hour a day, and I did, at first, but… Why is it so hard… sometimes.. --- {i}Yawn{/i}."
    sky "你敢信吗？我买了把吉他，结果根本不会弹！我本来打算每天练半小时的，一开始也确实做到了，可…… 怎么就这么难呢…… 有时候……——{i}（哈欠）{/i}。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:386
translate chinese b1m1_1b620cc6:

    # "The last word is broken up by a lengthy (and adorable) yawn that [sky] makes no effort to suppress."
    "最后几个字被[sky]一个绵长（还带着点可爱）的哈欠打断了，她完全没想着要掩饰。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:388
translate chinese b1m1_f5c1f9bc:

    # sky "It’s getting late. I should head back to my place…"
    sky "时候不早了，我该回家了......"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:390
translate chinese b1m1_fe5bfa93:

    # sky "But, um… If you’re up for it, you could come with me. It’d be nice to have some company. I mean, if you don’t mind."
    sky "但，额......要是你不介意的话，要不要跟我一起走？有个人作伴挺好的。就，如果你不介意的话。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:391
translate chinese b1m1_b3d6e615:

    # "The invitation is wrapped in a shyness that contrasts sharply with the earlier fire in her eyes. It’s an offer veiled in indifference, but I can tell she wants me to come."
    "她的邀请带着羞涩，与之前眼中的热情形成鲜明对比。虽然语气平淡，但我看得出她希望我去。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:392
translate chinese b1m1_c8b046d2:

    # mc "I’d like that. Lead the way, [sky]."
    mc "没问题，带路吧，[sky]。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:394
translate chinese b1m1_3381f695:

    # "Her face lights up, a genuine smile breaking across her features. She reaches for her phone, tapping out her number with a quick, confident flourish before handing it to me."
    "她的脸上露出了真诚的笑容。她拿起手机，快速自信地敲出自己的电话号码，然后递给我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:396
translate chinese b1m1_3ae7d976:

    # sky "Here. Just in case you want to keep in touch. I’ve got a feeling we’ll be seeing more of each other."
    sky "给你，如果以后你想保持联系的话。我有预感，我们会经常见面的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:400
translate chinese b1m1_5098e9f7:

    # "We leave The Riding Mare together, the cool night air greeting us as we step out. The streets are quiet, the city’s heartbeat slow and steady beneath the starlit sky. As we walk, her hand brushes against mine, a touch that feels both natural and electric."
    "我们一起离开骑驹，凉爽的夜风拂面而来。街道很安静，星空下，城市的心跳缓慢而平稳。走着走着，她的手轻轻地拂过我的手，那种触感既自然又触动着我的心弦。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:401
translate chinese b1m1_c7161f9f:

    # "… Only ten minutes later…"
