translate chinese bar2_068691ef:

    # sky "Listen, [rik]… I know things have been rough, but you can’t just focus on the negativity. There are still people that look up to you – they always have – and now you have a chance to be a role model in a way that truly matters."
    sky "听着，[rik]…… 我知道万事总有难处，但你不能只盯着那些负面的东西。仍然有人敬佩你 —— 一直都有 —— 而现在，你有机会成为一个真正有意义的榜样。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:684
translate chinese bar2_d9fadb9e:

    # "[rik] pulls away from [sky]’s touch, expression flashing with anger."
    "[rik]挣脱了[sky]的触碰，脸上闪过一丝怒意。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:685
translate chinese bar2_fe55fa72:

    # rik "You don’t get it, [sky]. You haven’t had to face the pitying stares, the hushed gossip, the constant reminder of how far you’ve fallen."
    rik "你不懂，[sky]。你没经历过那些同情的目光、窃窃私语的流言，还有那些无时无刻不在提醒你摔得有多惨的东西。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:686
translate chinese bar2_bf2bfb33:

    # rik "I’m a washed-up joke, and everyone knows it."
    rik "我只是个过气的笑话，所有人都知道。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:687
translate chinese bar2_9a372c54:

    # "I lean back on my chair, my voice steady and calm."
    "我向后靠在椅子上，声音平稳而冷静。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:688
translate chinese bar2_3c57a8c6:

    # mc "Then you clearly don’t get what I’m asking you, [rik]. I don’t care about your mistakes or past failures."
    mc "那你显然没明白我在表达什么，[rik]。我不在乎你的过失，也不在乎你过去的失败。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:690
translate chinese bar2_26f168e4:

    # rik "Huh? Don’t play me like I’m dumb."
    rik "哈？别拿我我当傻子耍。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:691
translate chinese bar2_1b06dacc:

    # mc "[sky] has made some good points, but the initiative isn’t about bringing athletics back, not really."
    mc "[sky]说得有几分道理，但这个计划并非真的是为了重振体育事业。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:692
translate chinese bar2_b09c86a0:

    # mc "It’s about kicking the ass of the nightmares and saving this country. Sports might come back, and you might become a hero for that, but it’s not part of my pitch or my promise."
    mc "这事儿的关键是要狠狠教训那些噩梦般的存在，拯救这个国家。体育事业或许会因此复兴，你也可能会因此成为英雄，但这些都不在我的计划或承诺之内。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:693
translate chinese bar2_3dabf5dd:

    # mc "A record-breaking, badass flier is exactly what the team needs. You are who we need, and I can’t accept anyone else. Not [sky], not your second-best, not a royal guard, {i}you{/i}."
    mc "一位破纪录的、身手不凡的飞行家，正是这支队伍所需要的。我们需要的就是你，我不可能接受其他人 —— 无论是[sky]，还是仅次于你的人，亦或是皇家护卫队的成员都不行，{i}你{/i}。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:695
translate chinese bar2_d3597cb8:

    # rik "Me? But… I’m not the person you think I am. I gave up. I’m a loser."
    rik "我？可是…… 我并不是你想象中的那个人。我已经放弃了，我就是个失败者。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:696
translate chinese bar2_b80ea90e:

    # mc "We’re all flawed, all struggling to find our way. But that’s what makes us who we are – that’s what gives us the chance to make a difference. If we were all perfect, there’d be no need."
    mc "我们每个人都有缺点，都在挣扎着寻找方向。但正是这些经历塑造了我们，也给了我们做出改变的机会。如果我们都完美无缺，那反而就没有这样的必要了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:697
translate chinese bar2_9435a1ac:

    # "All the anger fades from [rik], replaced with a profound weariness."
    "[rik]身上的怒气渐渐消散，取而代之的是一种深深的疲惫。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:699
translate chinese bar2_ff792326:

    # rik "I just don’t know if I can do this… You know? I don’t know if I have it in me to fight anymore."
    rik "我只是不确定自己还能不能做到…… 你明白吗？我不知道自己心里还有没有那份抗争的力气了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:700
translate chinese bar2_af8f4bac:

    # mc "I’m not going to sit here and tell you it’ll be easy. But you won’t be alone, not by a long shot. We’ll be there right with you, every step of the way."
    mc "我不会坐在这儿跟你说这事儿会很轻松。但你绝不会孤身一人，绝对不会。我们会陪着你，每一步都陪着你。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:701
translate chinese bar2_a2dcebe1:

    # "Something about those exact set of words causes [rik] to stir, her ears twitching."
    "恰恰是这几句话，让[rik]有所触动，她的耳朵微微动了动。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:702
translate chinese bar2_82808ea2:

    # mc "And I believe in you, [rik]. I believe in your strength and your ability to make a difference."
    mc "而且我相信你，[rik]。我相信你的力量，也相信你有能力带来改变。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:704
translate chinese bar2_a6ae45ec:

    # "[sky] nods in agreement, her eyes shining with unshed tears."
    "[sky]点头表示赞同，眼里闪烁着强忍的泪光。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:705
translate chinese bar2_7a0c4460:

    # sky "Yes! We’ll support you, challenge you, and celebrate your victories! but more than that, we’ll always believe in you, even when you can’t believe in yourself."
    sky "对！我们会支持你，磨练你，为你的胜利喝彩！不仅如此，即便在你对自己失去信心的时候，我们也会一直相信你。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:706
translate chinese bar2_611f93ea:

    # "[rik] takes a deep, shuddering breath, her composure crumbling."
    "[rik]颤抖着深吸一口气，再也无法保持镇定。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:708
translate chinese bar2_c000f107:

    # rik "I-I can’t promise I won’t stumble or fall, but… I’ll try."
    rik "我…… 我不能保证自己不会犯错或失败，但…… 我会努力的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:710
translate chinese bar2_92417290:

    # rik "For the first time, in a long time, I’ll try. So, count me in – for now."
    rik "长久以来，这是我第一次…… 愿意去尝试。所以，算我一个 —— 暂时。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:711
translate chinese bar2_45ba7e52:

    # "I raise my half-empty glass for one last toast."
    "我举起半满的酒杯，准备敬最后一杯。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:712
translate chinese bar2_007bb9ec:

    # mc "One more time. Not to the past, but to new beginnings. May we stumble down this path together."
    mc "再干一杯。不为过去，只为新的开始。愿我们一同在这条路上跌跌撞撞，携手前行。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:715
translate chinese bar2_5a7cae66:

    # "The three of us finally lean back in our cushioned booth seats and feel the collective sigh of relief as the tension vanishes between us. I can even feel my drunkenness returning as if it’d taken a short break during that serious conversation."
    "我们三人终于向后靠在铺着软垫的卡座座椅上，紧绷的气氛烟消云散，大家不约而同地松了口气。我甚至能感觉到醉意重新袭来，仿佛在刚才那场严肃的谈话中，它只是短暂地退居一旁歇了歇脚。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:717
translate chinese bar2_f71de362:

    # "I notice [sky]’s eyes buzzing around. It looks like the speed dating is in full swing. [rik], finally clocks on to this too."
    "我注意到[sky]的目光在四处打转。看来速配活动正进行得如火如荼。[rik]也终于察觉到了这一点。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:719
translate chinese bar2_14a737ea:

    # rik "Hah, I can’t believe you invited me today of all days. You’re not trying to be a matchmaker now, [sky]?"
    rik "哈，真没想到你偏偏选今天邀我来。[sky]，你该不会是想当媒人吧？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:721
translate chinese bar2_54b160e6:

    # sky "Awh, but [rik], look at all these hot singles vying for attention. This seems like your scene."
    sky "喔，可是[rik]，你瞧瞧这些魅力单身人士都在想方设法吸引目光呢。这地方看着就很适合你啊。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:722
translate chinese bar2_d3838ee1:

    # "She casually gestures her hand over the crowded bar; I can’t help but notice how her wave made an effort to include me."
    "她漫不经心地抬手扫过拥挤的酒吧；我不由注意到，她挥手的动作特意将我也划了进去。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:723
translate chinese bar2_4fff33af:

    # mc "I couldn’t imagine [rik] doing the whole speed dating scene. Not with her reputation."
    mc "我无法想象[rik]会参与这种速配活动。以她的名声来看，绝不可能。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:725
translate chinese bar2_0f6b9aad:

    # rik "Forget ‘speed dating,’ I can’t even manage normal dating. This might be the first normal conversation I’ve had with a stranger in a long time; you’re not bashing me for my scandals or worshipping me like I’m a goddess."
    rik "别提什么“速配”了，我连正常约会都搞不定。这或许是我很久以来第一次和陌生人进行正常的交谈 —— 你既没有因为那些丑闻抨击我，也没有把我当成女神一样崇拜。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:726
translate chinese bar2_ff35443f:

    # mc "I don’t even know anything about your scandals."
    mc "我对你的那些丑闻一无所知。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:728
translate chinese bar2_5215aa99:

    # rik "See? I like this guy, [sky]. We need more guys like him."
    rik "看吧？我喜欢这家伙，[sky]。我们就需要更多像他这样的人。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:730
translate chinese bar2_2a358757:

    # rik "I have this habit of ending up with losers. And I’m not saying that in the ‘red flag’ kind of way; I genuinely mean it. My previous two partners both cheated on me."
    rik "我总是改不了和渣男纠缠不清的毛病。我可不是说那种 “有危险信号” 的意思，我是真心这么觉得。我两个前任都出轨了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:731
translate chinese bar2_8a90e14b:

    # rik "And would you believe it, the last one managed to spin the story into {i}me{/i} cheating on {i}him{/i}! Even though I broke up with his sorry ass a week prior. But Sporting Harmony accepted his story!"
    rik "而且你敢信吗？上一任居然还颠倒黑白，说是{i}我{/i}出轨{i}他{/i}！可我一周前就跟他那倒霉蛋分手了啊。但 “体育和谐” 居然信了他的鬼话！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:732
translate chinese bar2_62e7e247:

    # mc "I hear it’s petty high school drama all the way down."
    mc "听说这里面从头到尾都是些幼稚的高中闹剧。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:734
translate chinese bar2_48e13104:

    # rik "Haha, you have no idea! But hey, you know, forget the scandals. This is kind of fun, just talking about anything and everything with someone that doesn’t know much about me."
    rik "哈哈，谁知道他！不过嘛，算了，不提那些丑闻了。就这样和一个不太了解我的人东拉西扯，还挺有意思的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:736
translate chinese bar2_c4f8ddb4:

    # sky "Hmm… So, this speed dating thing… Are you two interested? It could be fun to join in."
    sky "嗯……那么，这个速配活动……你们俩有兴趣吗？参与一下或许会挺有意思的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:738
translate chinese bar2_2fbb9186:

    # rik "Tsk, you know what this 'speed dating' really is, don't you? I’m not looking for a pity fuck from some random schmuck. Not like any of them could keep up with me anyway."
    rik "啧，你知道这所谓的 “速配” 到底是啥玩意儿，对吧？我可不需要某个随便什么家伙来可怜我、跟我发生关系。再说了，他们中也没谁能配得上我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:740
translate chinese bar2_895136a7:

    # sky "Heh, where was that confidence earlier? What are you looking for in a partner, then? You know, for my own curiosity’s sake."
    sky "呵，你这股自信劲儿早去哪儿了？那你想找个什么样的伴侣啊？嗯…… 就当满足一下我的好奇心呗。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:742
translate chinese bar2_9180f00e:

    # rik "I-I mean… Don’t we all just want someone we can make out with at parties?"
    rik "我…… 我是说…… 我们不都只是想找个能在派对上亲热的人吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:743
translate chinese bar2_7e193efa:

    # "[rik] laughs nervously, her eyes turning to me but then immediately flickering away. She adjusts her crossed legs, accidentally showing a significant amount of thigh. I’m not complaining."
    "[rik]尴尬地笑了笑，目光转向我，但又立刻移开了。她调整了一下交叉着的双腿，不经意间露出了大片大腿的肌肤。我可没什么好抱怨的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:745
translate chinese bar2_8dc9fd29:

    # sky "Aahhh… You’re never going to get anyone like that with your current attitude! Why don’t you pretend you’re having a speed date with [mc] right now?"
    sky "啊啊啊…… 就你这态度，永远也找不到那样的人！你现在就假装在跟[mc]速配约会不行吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:747
translate chinese bar2_976bf817:

    # "Is [sky] being my wingwoman right now? Although [sky]’s suggestion only seems to annoy [rik], so I guess it’s not working."
    "[sky]这会儿是在给我当僚机吗？不过[sky]的建议似乎只惹得[rik]不快，所以我猜这法子没起作用。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:748
translate chinese bar2_40c16d23:

    # "[rik] sighs and pushes away her drink before leaning in close towards me."
    "[rik]叹了口气，推开面前的饮料，又向我凑近了些。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:750
translate chinese bar2_cdc25b71:

    # rik "Well, this might be the wrong thing to say in front of you, but I’m an athlete at the peak of my life. 100%% healthy mare. My body is tuned to be a lean, mean pleasure machine."
    rik "唉，在你面前说这些可能不太合适，但我是一名正值巅峰的运动员。100%%健康的母马。我的身体就是一台调校到极致的、精瘦又带劲的 “快乐机器”。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:752
translate chinese bar2_5bb3a916:

    # "[sky] nearly spit out her drink at the statement, coughing and laughing simultaneously. [rik] just smirks, enjoying the shock."
    "[sky]听到这话，差点把喝的饮料喷出来，一边咳嗽一边笑。[rik]则只是得意地坏笑，享受着这种让人猝不及防的效果。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:753
translate chinese bar2_353d6bc0:

    # mc "Is that so, [rik]? And what exactly is stopping you from showing me just how ‘mean’ you are, hmm?"
    mc "是这样吗，[rik]？那到底是什么让你不给我看看你到底有多 “带劲” 呢，嗯？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:754
translate chinese bar2_4c3bd85c:

    # "I casually wrap an arm around her shoulder. I can feel some tension in her body as it pushes against me. Her smirk darkens to a sultrier expression, eyes flicking down to my own chest."
    "我漫不经心地用一只胳膊搂住她的肩膀。能感觉到她身体抵着我时的一丝紧绷。她的坏笑渐渐变得更撩人，目光向下扫过我的胸口。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:756
translate chinese bar2_1d2a59c5:

    # rik "[mc]… Maybe you could join me later, and I could show you exactly what my body can do."
    rik "[mc]…… 或许你之后可以过来找我，到时候我就能让你清清楚楚看到，我的身体到底能做到什么。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:757
translate chinese bar2_703c077b:

    # "She holds a suggestive gaze for a moment longer before breaking away with a light laugh and a playful wink."
    "她用带着暗示的眼神凝望了片刻，随后才轻笑一声，俏皮地眨了眨眼，移开了目光。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:759
translate chinese bar2_d2a25f92:

    # sky "Ooohh, baby! There's that confidence!"
    sky "哦哦哦，宝贝儿！自信起来了嘛！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:761
translate chinese bar2_72daf9cf:

    # rik "Wouldn’t have been able to do that sober... Was it too much?"
    rik "没喝酒的话，我肯定做不出这种事…… 是不是有点太过火了"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:762
translate chinese bar2_b07395f5:

    # "[rik] asks, feigning innocence. But the packed bar is buzzing with flirtatious energy, and it’s clear [rik] has been swept up in it. She hasn’t moved away from me an inch."
    "[rik]故作无辜地问道。但热闹的酒吧里满是打情骂俏的氛围，显然[rik]也被这股气氛感染了 —— 她一英寸都没从我身边挪开。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:763
translate chinese bar2_da610235:

    # mc "Too much? Far from it."
    mc "太过火？哪止啊。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:764
translate chinese bar2_9a1ed3f4:

    # "I lean forward and whisper into her ear."
    "我倾身向前，对着她的耳朵低语。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:765
translate chinese bar2_2278ebca:

    # mc "I want to see exactly what you can do. But there’s one thing you got wrong. I won’t be struggling to keep up with you; you’ll be struggling to handle me~"
    mc "我想看看你到底有多大能耐。但有一件事你说错了 —— 我不会拼命跟上你的节奏，而是你得费尽心思想办法应付我呢～"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:766
translate chinese bar2_625924b0:

    # "I gave her ear a quick nip, causing her to gasp subtly, her ears lying flat against her face, a wide blush spreading from cheek to cheek."
    "我飞快地轻咬了一下她的耳朵，她微微倒抽一口气，耳朵紧紧贴在脸上，一抹浓重的红晕从脸颊一路蔓延开来。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:767
translate chinese bar2_e271fd56:

    # "As confident as she’s always been. But I know something that I shouldn't. [rik] is a massive sub, and I know exactly how to make her melt~"
    "她还是一如既往地自信。但我知道一件不该知道的事 —— [rik]是个十足的受，而且我清楚得很，该怎么让她服服帖帖的～"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:768
translate chinese bar2_806fa38f:

    # "A quick peak between her thighs is all the confirmation I need to see that she’s feeling hot down there too."
    "飞快扫过她的大腿之间，仅此一眼便足以确认 —— 她身下也早已燥热难耐。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:770
translate chinese bar2_ab52520f:

    # rik "Uuu…"
    rik "呜......"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:772
translate chinese bar2_6d3a3660:

    # sky "Alright, alright! Settle down, lovebirds. We don’t want to cause a scene."
    sky "好了好了！别腻歪了，小情侣们。咱们可别在这儿闹出事来。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:774
translate chinese bar2_2d4c1fbf:

    # rik "Oohh, [sky] is jealous! I think she wants to join in~"
    rik "哦哦哦，[sky]这是吃醋了呀！我看她是也想加入进来～"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:776
translate chinese bar2_b1994392:

    # sky "Ah, please… You two can keep each other entertained for a while. Besides, it’s getting late, and I need to wake up for a morning shift tomorrow."
    sky "啊，得了吧…… 你们俩先自己找乐子玩会儿就行。再说了，时间不早了，我明天还得早起上班呢。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:778
translate chinese bar2_73cc4967:

    # rik "Awh, you can’t go yet, the night’s only just getting started! I was thinking we could go hit some clubs."
    rik "哎，你可不能就这么走啊，夜晚才刚开始呢！我本来还想着咱们可以去泡几家酒吧来着。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:780
translate chinese bar2_dd30c188:

    # sky "Pfft, look what you’ve done now, [mc]. [rik] usually hates the club, so it can only mean one thing."
    sky "噗，瞧瞧你现在干的好事，[mc]。[rik]平时最讨厌去酒吧了，所以这只能说明一件事。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:781
translate chinese bar2_db7b11fd:

    # mc "What’s that?"
    mc "啥？"

