translate chinese bar4_860b8cb3:

    # "She led me to the balcony, and the cool night air hit my skin. In an instant, [rik]'s wings were spread wide—powerful, graceful."
    "她带我走到阳台，凉夜空气拂过皮肤。[rik]瞬间展开双翼——强健而优雅。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1503
translate chinese bar4_c1a9b14e:

    # "She motioned for me to stand in front of her and then she wrapped her arms around me in a snug position."
    "她示意我站到她身前，然后用双臂稳稳环抱住我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1505
translate chinese bar4_6cfedb2e:

    # rik "Does this feel comfortable?"
    rik "这样舒服吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1506
translate chinese bar4_19f0428e:

    # mc "Yep! Kinda!"
    mc "嗯！还行！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1507
translate chinese bar4_aea7bfed:

    # rik "You know, I wouldn't be able to do this without the virtue's power you granted me. Reckon I'll be returning that favor for a while~"
    rik "要知道，没有你赐予的美德力量我可做不到这些。估计我得好好回报你一阵子啦～"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1508
translate chinese bar4_ba076016:

    # mc "Awh, you don't have to - woah!"
    mc "噢，不用——哇！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1511
translate chinese bar4_f50ef9d3:

    # "She took off, soaring into the night. Her wings cut through the air with ease."
    "她腾空而起，融入夜空。双翼轻松划破空气。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1513
translate chinese bar4_10732711:

    # "I catch myself gasping as we rise, the city sprawled beneath us in an expanse of lights, buildings, and the deep night sky."
    "上升时我忍不住吸气，城市在脚下铺展成灯火、建筑与深邃夜空的浩瀚画卷。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1514
translate chinese bar4_4e854ee4:

    # "Arcadia looks different from up here—a patchwork of glowing streets and towering skyscrapers, the hum of life seeming so far away."
    " Arcadia从高处看截然不同——发光的街道与摩天大楼交织成锦，生命的嗡鸣显得遥远。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1515
translate chinese bar4_7c266b98:

    # "As [rik] glides through the night, I’m struck by how natural she makes it seem. It’s such a smooth flight that I don’t think I’d ever get motion sickness."
    "当[rik]在夜色中滑翔时，我惊异于她表现得如此自然。飞行平稳得让我根本不可能晕。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1516
translate chinese bar4_cb67229e:

    # "This certainly makes me realize how and why [rik] and [sky] seem to get around so fast. It seems obvious, but up here you truly realize just how much faster it is than walking."
    "这确实让我明白[rik]和[sky]为何总能快速移动。虽然显而易见，但在高空才能真正体会比步行快多少。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1518
translate chinese bar4_770daf89:

    # "We land outside the bar with barely a sound."
    "我们在酒吧外悄然着陆。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1520
translate chinese bar4_5e2ce84c:

    # rik "Easy peasy! Let’s head inside."
    rik "小菜一碟！我们进去吧。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1521
translate chinese bar4_19098ac5:

    # "Why do I feel like I’m the one that needs to catch my breath after that?"
    "怎么感觉我才是需要喘口气的那个？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1525
translate chinese bar4_ca745f3e:

    # "The warmth of the bar greets us, and it’s not long before I spot [sky] at a table near the back. She’s leaning in, laughing with another mare I can’t see from this angle."
    "酒吧的暖意扑面而来，我很快注意到[sky]坐在靠后的桌旁。她正俯身笑着，和另一匹从这个角度看不到的雌驹交谈。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1528
translate chinese bar4_02e06230:

    # "But I’m caught off guard when we step closer, and I realize it’s [blo]!"
    "但当我们走近时，我惊讶地发现那是[blo]！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1531
translate chinese bar4_489a4b06:

    # "She looked flustered when she notices [rik], but as her gaze moves over to me, she does a double-take and relaxes."
    "她注意到[rik]时显得有些慌张，但当目光移到我身上时，她愣了一下便放松下来。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1533
translate chinese bar4_37f4082a:

    # sky "I was starting to think you were going to leave us hanging forever! I texted you two over thirty minutes ago."
    sky "我开始以为你们要放我们鸽子了！三十分钟前就给你们发过消息。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1534
translate chinese bar4_1589fc28:

    # mc "Sorry, you know how it is. Had to handle some last-minute things."
    mc "抱歉，你知道的。临时有些事要处理。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1536
translate chinese bar4_649508e8:

    # rik "Had a power nap—followed by a shower! You know, priorities~"
    rik "小睡了一会儿——还洗了个澡！懂得都懂～"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1538
translate chinese bar4_c6256100:

    # sky "That sounds about right. You’ve been super busy recently, so I’m just glad you had the time at all."
    sky "这很合理。你最近特别忙，能抽出时间我就很开心了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1540
translate chinese bar4_2cb3ad9b:

    # rik "Yeah, it’s great to catch up, [sky], and… I recognize you from the party, [hon]’s sister?"
    rik "是啊，能聚聚真好，[sky],还有…我在派对上见过你，[hon]的妹妹？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1542
translate chinese bar4_ce104f0e:

    # sky "Well remembered! This is [blo]. We go way back — elementary school days… Imagine my shock when we bumped into each other at the castle?"
    sky "记性真好！这是[blo]。我们认识很久了——从小学就……你能想象在城堡偶遇时我有多震惊吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1543
translate chinese bar4_828e0f6f:

    # sky "It’s been too long since we caught up properly. Life got in the way."
    sky "确实太久没好好聚了。生活总是忙忙碌碌。  "

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1545
translate chinese bar4_1c39cd39:

    # blo "It’s, um, nice to see you again, [rik]. And [mc] too! You didn’t tell me you were inviting him!"
    blo "呃，又见到你真好，[rik]。还有[mc]！你没告诉我邀请了他呀！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1547
translate chinese bar4_4cf0fa66:

    # sky "Ehehe, I wasn’t sure how close you two were. Turns out we’re all buddies here!"
    sky "嘿嘿，我不确定你俩有多熟。结果发现咱们都是朋友！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1548
translate chinese bar4_cddff9e5:

    # mc "Small world, huh? But it’s good to see you out and about."
    mc "世界真小啊？不过看到你出来活动真好。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1550
translate chinese bar4_2b54cd49:

    # sky "It was actually [blo] that reached out first hoping to reconnect. I thought, why not?"
    sky "其实是[blo]先联系我想重聚的。我觉得，何乐而不为呢？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1551
translate chinese bar4_075fa5ad:

    # sky "I told her we could meet up, maybe call a few more friends, and make an evening out of it."
    sky "我说我们可以见面，再叫上几个朋友，共度夜晚。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1553
translate chinese bar4_7261896a:

    # blo "[sky], you didn’t tell me you were inviting two of the most famous people in the country! I would have spent more time in front of my mirror preparing what to say."
    blo "[sky]，你没告诉我邀请了全国最著名的两个人！我该在镜子前多准备些说辞的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1555
translate chinese bar4_1d924e30:

    # sky "Ehehe, chill out. They’re not ‘famous people’ to us, they’re just friends."
    sky "呵呵，放松点。对我们来说他们不是“名人”，只是朋友啦。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1557
translate chinese bar4_51ccbad1:

    # rik "That’s right. Forget everything you think you know about me. Tonight? I’m just a friend."
    rik "没错。忘掉你以为关于我的一切。今晚？我只是个朋友。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1559
translate chinese bar4_0b87edce:

    # blo "Of course, you're right. I don't see my sister any differently just because of everything that happened."
    blo "当然，你说得对。我不会因为发生的事就用不同眼光看待我姐姐。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1561
translate chinese bar4_1f2c1276:

    # rik "Speaking of [hon]. What a gal she is! With her strength and my speed, we’re an unstoppable duo."
    rik "说到[hon]。她可真了不起！她的力量加上我的速度，我们就是无敌二人组。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1563
translate chinese bar4_cb7d3b21:

    # blo "Hehe, she regards you in much the same way."
    blo "呵呵，她对你也抱有同样的看法。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1565
translate chinese bar4_9b575c97:

    # rik "I’m looking forward to getting to know all the virtues a lot better, but it seems I’ve caught the brunt of the ‘celebrity’ side of our group."
    rik "我很期待更深入了解所有的谐律们，但看来我承担了团队里“名人”方面的主要压力。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1566
translate chinese bar4_32c65171:

    # rik "So… Yeah, I’m doing a lot of the interviews, photoshoots, and talk shows. As well as spearheading the return of sports…"
    rik "所以…嗯，我做了很多采访、拍摄和脱口秀。还负责推动体育赛事回归…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1567
translate chinese bar4_e7946f64:

    # mc "It must beat the political side that [lil] has to deal with."
    mc "这肯定比[lil]要处理的政治事务轻松些。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1569
translate chinese bar4_b76893f7:

    # rik "For sure, but no less tiring, I imagine."
    rik "当然，但我想也不会更轻松。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1570
translate chinese bar4_4bac4641:

    # mc "We appreciate what you’re doing. It gives everyone else less experienced in that world more room to breathe."
    mc "我们感谢你所做的一切。它给了那个世界经验不足的人更多喘息的时间。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1572
translate chinese bar4_2db06175:

    # blo "With sports coming back, what do you plan to do?"
    blo "随着体育赛事回归，你打算做什么呢？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1574
translate chinese bar4_75912045:

    # rik "Huh… Well…"
    rik "嗯…这个嘛…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1575
translate chinese bar4_a4178b06:

    # rik "It'd feel like cheating if I started to compete with my new magic boost."
    rik "要是用我新获得的魔法去比赛，总觉得有点胜之不武呢。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1576
translate chinese bar4_5f07cb0e:

    # "[blo] loosens up as the conversation unfolds. [rik] and [sky] trade more stories, their easy banter giving me an idea of their future plans."
    "[blo]随着谈话的展开逐渐放松下来。[rik]和[sky]互相分享更多故事，她们轻松的玩笑让我对他们未来的计划有了些想法。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1577
translate chinese bar4_a498f981:

    # "It’s inspiring to listen to, and I can see [blo] leaning in, genuinely curious."
    "听着真让人振奋，我能看出[blo]身体微微前倾，是真正被激起了好奇。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1579
translate chinese bar4_04a59af9:

    # blo "How did you discover that flying was your calling?"
    blo "你是怎么发现飞行才是自己真正想做的事的？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1581
translate chinese bar4_d52e70ce:

    # rik "Other than having an obsessively competitive personality? My parents were the ones who made it possible. They got me into classes early."
    rik "除了天生好胜的性格之外？其实是我父母为我创造了条件。他们很早就送我去上飞行课了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1583
translate chinese bar4_94460486:

    # blo "Flying classes? I’ve heard of those before, but you’ll have to excuse me, there aren’t many pegasi around here."
    blo "飞行课？我以前倒是听说过，不过你知道的，我们这儿确实很少见到天马。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1585
translate chinese bar4_a6a2c432:

    # sky "It’s like, uhm… swimming classes, right? It’s a fundamental mode of transport that all of us can engage in, but it’s not entirely intuitive without being taught."
    sky "这就好比……嗯……游泳课，对吧？虽然飞行是咱们都能掌握的基本出行方式，但没人教的话确实不容易无师自通。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1587
translate chinese bar4_383edd5d:

    # rik "Exactly. And just like swimming, if you’ve got talent, the instructors push you to higher levels."
    rik "没错。而且就像游泳一样，如果你有天分，教练就会推着你往更高阶段进阶。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1588
translate chinese bar4_b5c42b9e:

    # rik "All of a sudden it was no longer about flying in safe, straight lines; I was learning advanced manoeuvring techniques."
    rik "突然间训练就不再是平稳直线飞行了，我开始学习各种高级机动技巧。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1589
translate chinese bar4_fd2987de:

    # mc "That’s fascinating. I don’t know why it never crossed my mind that pegasi would have flying lessons, but it makes complete sense."
    mc "有意思。虽然我从来没想过天马也需要上飞行课，但这么一说确实合情合理。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1591
translate chinese bar4_14917bfa:

    # sky "Yeah, I get it. It’s not like you had ‘walking classes,’ right? But flight requires lessons on safety, especially for children."
    sky "是啊，我明白。就像你们也不用专门上\"走路课\"对吧？但飞行必须学习安全规范，尤其是对孩子们来说。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1593
translate chinese bar4_b230750d:

    # blo "So, what’s the path for a child with natural talent? How do they get to be an athlete?"
    blo "那么，有天赋的孩子该怎么培养呢？他们是如何成为运动员的？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1595
translate chinese bar4_168ab244:

    # rik "I signed up for the local flight squad, which is when the coach notices I’m faster than all the other fillies."
    rik "我报名参加了本地的飞行队，那时候教练发现我比所有小马驹飞得都要快。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1597
translate chinese bar4_dd663c65:

    # rik "That’s when they start pushing me more; training me harder than everyone else."
    rik "就是从那时候开始，他们对我要求更严格了，给我的训练强度远远超过其他队员。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1598
translate chinese bar4_307178d8:

    # rik "After winning a bunch of races, my parents were the ones that asked if I wanted to get serious about this. They could sign me up for regional competitions."
    rik "赢了好几场比赛后，是我父母主动问我是否真的想走这条路。他们可以帮我报名参加地区级赛事。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1600
translate chinese bar4_8d5c207b:

    # rik "Suddenly, there was money on the line. Pressure started to build. All eyes on me…"
    rik "突然间就涉及到奖金了。压力开始堆积，所有人的目光都聚焦在我身上……"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1602
translate chinese bar4_1c605be1:

    # rik "And I loved it. I had to, otherwise I couldn’t have reached the heights I did."
    rik "可我偏偏热爱这种氛围。必须热爱，否则根本不可能达到后来的成就。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1604
translate chinese bar4_55eb60db:

    # sky "Those are the best moments. When it doesn’t get… well, you know."
    sky "那些才是最棒的时刻啊。没出什么…… 嗯，你懂的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1606
translate chinese bar4_7fed0170:

    # blo "What? What happens after that?"
    blo "什么？后来发生了什么？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1608
translate chinese bar4_6db4cc70:

    # rik "Eh, well… 24/7 focus on diet, recovery, and training. Cut out all distractions. Friends? Gone. Social life? What’s that?"
    rik "唉，就……一天 24 小时、一周 7 天，满脑子都得盯着饮食、恢复和训练。所有能让人分心的事都得戒掉。朋友？走了。社交生活？那玩意儿是啥？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1609
translate chinese bar4_c638e432:

    # rik "To be the best, you need to sacrifice absolutely everything that doesn’t get you closer to being the best."
    rik "要想成为最顶尖的人，就得彻底舍弃所有无法帮你更接近顶尖的东西。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1611
translate chinese bar4_a81fb536:

    # rik "I’ve been there. I’ve got the gold medal. It was worth it, but... do I want to do that again? I’m not sure anymore."
    rik "我也经历过那种日子，手里也拿过金牌。那些付出确实值得，但…… 我还想再来一次吗？我现在已经不确定了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1613
translate chinese bar4_c69478d1:

    # sky "Balance is key to a healthy lifestyle. But there’s no balance in that…"
    sky "健康生活的关键在于平衡。但那种状态...根本谈不上平衡。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1614
translate chinese bar4_e13119e5:

    # sky "I’ve actually gotten used to not being [rik]’s apprentice. I’m a full-time trainer now. Funny thing is, I like it more than the ‘fast life.’"
    sky "其实我已经习惯不再当[rik]的学徒了。现在我是全职教练——有意思的是，我反而比过去追求\"快节奏生活\"时更快乐。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1616
translate chinese bar4_a924b51b:

    # rik "Sometimes, that’s enough, right? Constant competition can drive you mad. Set your own goals, do what feels right."
    rik "有时候，这样就够了，对吧？没完没了的竞争真的会把人逼疯。按照自己的节奏来，做感觉正确的事就好。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1617
translate chinese bar4_ec5e3ef3:

    # rik "I’ll be focused on my responsibilities as a virtue, but if I ever go back to sports, it’ll be as a coach or an analyst. No more competing for me."
    rik "我会把履行好职责当作首要目标，就算以后重返体育界，也只会做教练或分析师。再也不参与竞技比赛了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1619
translate chinese bar4_22a51604:

    # blo "Wow, that’s a huge shift."
    blo "哇，这转变可真够大的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1621
translate chinese bar4_c9f77c94:

    # rik "Yeah... if I keep competing now, I'll slaughter the competition, it'd be a breeze, and... Probably not worth it."
    rik "是啊…如果现在继续参赛，我会碾压所有对手，赢得太轻松，反而…没什么意思了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1622
translate chinese bar4_8740ba3d:

    # blo "{i}Not{/i} worth it? Why wouldn't winning be worth it?"
    blo "{i} 没意思 {/i}？赢了比赛怎么会不值得？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1624
translate chinese bar4_3214a090:

    # rik "Yeah, but... What about the others competing? The ones that try so hard every single day to be marginally better."
    rik "可是…其他参赛者呢？那些每天拼命训练只求进步一点点的人怎么办？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1625
translate chinese bar4_153e3e95:

    # rik "It wouldn't be fair for me to compete with these unprecedented magical powers."
    rik "用这种前所未有的魔法去比赛，对他们太不公平了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1627
translate chinese bar4_3754aa72:

    # blo "Oooohhh, I see what you mean now..."
    blo "哦——现在我明白你的意思了…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1629
translate chinese bar4_5b8c0141:

    # sky "[blo], what about you? What are your plans for the future?"
    sky "[blo]，你呢？对未来有什么打算？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1631
translate chinese bar4_2c27a09c:

    # blo "Oh, goodness… There’s so much I want to do, that it almost feels so overwhelming that I end up doing nothing! But... I’ve applied to a college to study music."
    blo "天哪…想做的事太多了，反而不知道该从何下手！不过…我已经申请了音乐学院。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1633
translate chinese bar4_7d33ad95:

    # sky "Congratulations! That sounds perfect. You were the only one in class who actually understood our music lessons."
    sky "恭喜！这选择太适合你了。当年班里只有你真正听得懂音乐课。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1635
translate chinese bar4_7bbc1a2e:

    # blo "Thanks, [sky]. I just hope I can find my place in such a big industry."
    blo "谢啦[sky]，我只希望能在这么大的行业里找到自己的位置。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1637
translate chinese bar4_e63d8b18:

    # rik "If you’re anything like your sister, there’s no question. Just follow your heart. That’s what it’s all about."
    rik "要是你能像你姐姐那样出色，肯定没问题。跟着感觉走就好，这才是最重要的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1639
translate chinese bar4_7cbf094a:

    # blo "Cheers to that!"
    blo "为这个干杯！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1642
translate chinese bar4_c28fb658:

    # "After about thirty minutes of chatting, [rik] finishes her drink and stands up."
    "聊了大概三十分钟后，[rik]喝完饮料站起身来。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1649
translate chinese bar4_c40d3760:

    # rik "I know it’s early, but I think I should head out before it gets too late."
    rik "我知道时间还早，不过我想趁天没黑透先回去了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1651
translate chinese bar4_6bfc37c2:

    # sky "Awh, already?"
    sky "啊，这就要走了？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1653
translate chinese bar4_1f91d187:

    # rik "Sorry, guys. I have some early morning appearances tomorrow. But it was great to get to know you properly, [blo]!"
    rik "抱歉啦各位，明天一大早还有通告要赶。不过今天能真正认识你真的很开心，[blo]！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1655
translate chinese bar4_507b0de9:

    # rik "And hey—nothing wild until I get back, okay?"
    rik "对了——在我回来之前别搞太夸张的动静，知道吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1657
translate chinese bar4_f9194692:

    # sky "Can’t promise that! Not with [mc] around."
    sky "这可保证不了！有[mc]在哪儿忍得住嘛。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1658
translate chinese bar4_dde1de1e:

    # mc "Hey, you’re just as bad as me!"
    mc "喂，你明明跟我半斤八两！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1660
translate chinese bar4_a75ef132:

    # rik "Pfftt, if you have a threesome, I want to hear the deats!"
    rik "噗，要是你们玩3P，我可要听细节哦！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1663
translate chinese bar4_a1b51c03:

    # "[rik] waves goodbye and leaves, leaving me, [sky], and [blo] sitting at the bar."
    "[rik]挥手道别后离开了，现在只剩下我、[sky]和[blo]还坐在吧台边。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1670
translate chinese bar4_9ddfac5e:

    # blo "D-Did she just say threesome?"
    blo "她-她刚才说了3P？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1672
translate chinese bar4_d4915c55:

    # sky "Oh, ignore her! She’s just joking…"
    sky "哦，别理她！她开玩笑的……"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1674
translate chinese bar4_cf99ec65:

    # sky "*{i}Whispering to me{/i}* She was joking, right?"
    sky "*{i} 对我耳语 {/i}*她是在开玩笑的，对吧？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1675
translate chinese bar4_a3aa05f0:

    # mc "*{i}Whispering back{/i}* Almost certainly not. This is [rik] we’re talking about."
    mc "*{i} 低声回应 {/i}*基本不是玩笑。我们说的可是[rik]。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1677
translate chinese bar4_3596bd5e:

    # blo "I’ve never been around someone so... famous. It’s kind of surreal."
    blo "我从没接触过这么…有名的人。有点超现实。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1679
translate chinese bar4_653f89ab:

    # sky "I get it. She’s a big deal, but once you get past all the glitz, she’s just... normal."
    sky "我懂。她确实是大人物，但抛开光环后，她只是……个普通人。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1680
translate chinese bar4_4875c040:

    # sky "But hey, let’s not forget that since Midnight was defeated, [mc] and [hon] are hot shots too."
    sky "不过别忘了，自从Midnight被击败后，[mc]和[hon]也是大红人了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1682
translate chinese bar4_3c795999:

    # blo "Hmm... everyone’s doing something. Living their lives. And it feels like I’m stuck."
    blo "嗯……大家都有所作为。过着他们的生活。而我好像还在原地踏步。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1683
translate chinese bar4_a558d170:

    # mc "Well, music, right? What draws you to that?"
    mc "音乐呢？是什么吸引你？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1685
translate chinese bar4_4da6e0ce:

    # blo "I’ve always loved music. When I need to clear my head, it’s the one thing I turn to. I even taught myself how to play my grandpap’s old banjo."
    blo "我一直热爱音乐。当我需要理清思绪时，它是我唯一的寄托。我甚至自学了祖父的旧班卓琴。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1686
translate chinese bar4_99a404d8:

    # blo "But it’s not just about playing. I want to compose music. I want to express myself in ways I can’t with words."
    blo "但不止是演奏。我想创作音乐。用言语无法表达的方式展现自我。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1688
translate chinese bar4_daff824b:

    # sky "That’s beautiful. I know it’s not easy, but with your passion, you could go far."
    sky "真漂亮。我知道不容易，但凭你的热情，能走很远。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1690
translate chinese bar4_be03af10:

    # blo "Thank you. That means a lot coming from you."
    blo "谢谢。你这么说对我意义重大。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1691
translate chinese bar4_71ca8981:

    # blo "And what about yourself? What drives you?"
    blo "那你呢？是什么驱动着你？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1693
translate chinese bar4_0a702319:

    # sky "Hum... I suppose I haven't really thought about that."
    sky "嗯……我好像没认真思考过这个。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1695
translate chinese bar4_50d414e4:

    # sky "I've enjoyed all the training and competition I've done throughout my life, but it's never quite matched the sense of fulfillment I feel in teaching others."
    sky "我享受一生所有的训练和比赛，但都比不上教导他人带来的成就感。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1697
translate chinese bar4_2363ad8f:

    # sky "It's even more satisfying seeing people learn, grow, and improve because of me."
    sky "看到人们因我而学习、成长、进步，更令人满足。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1699
translate chinese bar4_0d827f19:

    # blo "Wow, you're really inspiring!"
    blo "哇，你真会鼓舞人心！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1701
translate chinese bar4_2f4a0a36:

    # sky "That's the word! I love inspiring others!"
    sky "就是这个！我喜欢激励他人！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1703
translate chinese bar4_5c839ded:

    # blo "Back in school, you and [mel] were my world. It’s a shame we didn't stay connected."
    blo "当年在学校时，你和[mel]就是我的全世界。真遗憾后来没保持联系。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1705
translate chinese bar4_62fec831:

    # sky "Heh, yeah… I remember those sleepovers."
    sky "呵呵，是啊…我还记得那些留宿的时光。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1706
translate chinese bar4_e04c6249:

    # sky "Remember that time you said you were done with boys, and we pretended to date for a while?"
    sky "记得那次你说受够男生了，我们就假装交往了一阵吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1708
translate chinese bar4_fc13fcd4:

    # blo "Haha, oh, no. Are you really bringing up all our embarrassing memories in front of [mc]?"
    blo "哈哈，别啊。你真要在[mc]面前翻我们所有的糗事？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1709
translate chinese bar4_82746fd8:

    # mc "I’m loving every second of it."
    mc "我可喜欢这些故事了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1711
translate chinese bar4_c8a122c5:

    # sky "Alright, let’s pretend he’s not here for a second. Time for some real girly talk. Do you have anyone special in your life? Boyfriends? {i}Girlfriends{/i}?"
    sky "好啦，就当他不存在一会儿。该聊聊女孩子的话题了。你有特别的人吗？男朋友？{i} 女朋友 {/i}？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1713
translate chinese bar4_12c3b091:

    # blo "Uhm, well… there is one man I’ve had in mind."
    blo "呃，嗯…确实有个人在我心里。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1715
translate chinese bar4_352ea6a5:

    # blo "He… uh, he…"
    blo "他…呃，他……"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1717
translate chinese bar4_4f0849e4:

    # sky "Yessss?"
    sky "然后呢～？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1718
translate chinese bar4_d5395c0a:

    # "Well, well, well. If it isn’t the consequences of my actions."
    "好吧，好吧。这不就是我行为的后果吗。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1719
translate chinese bar4_86a4dec3:

    # mc "Just pretend I’m not here."
    mc "就当我不存在好了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1721
translate chinese bar4_79c37bcf:

    # blo "In that case… [sky], would you still be into a man even if they’re seeing other people?"
    blo "那样的话……[sky]，即使对方有别人，你还会喜欢他吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1723
translate chinese bar4_6032d611:

    # sky "Oooo, coming in with the hard-hitting questions."
    sky "哇哦，这问题可真够犀利的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1724
translate chinese bar4_eb3dc344:

    # sky "It’s a fact we outnumber the men here by a lot, so it’s common, at least. The guy I’m interested in? He’s definitely slept with [rik] and some others."
    sky "毕竟这儿女生数量远超过男生，这种情况挺常见的。我喜欢的那个男生？他肯定跟[rik]还有其他人有过关系。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1726
translate chinese bar4_abcbde55:

    # "Have I? Close enough, I suppose."
    "我有吗？差不多算是有过吧。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1728
translate chinese bar4_003425b2:

    # blo "S-Seriously? You don’t get jealous?"
    blo "真-真的吗？你不会吃醋的吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1730
translate chinese bar4_c9280281:

    # sky "Jealous? Nah. It just makes me hotter. But hey, that’s just me and my competitive streak. I’d understand if it bothered you."
    sky "吃醋？才不会呢。反而让我觉得他更有魅力了。不过嘛，这就是我好胜心在作祟啦，要是你在意的话我完全能理解。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1732
translate chinese bar4_d32ca548:

    # blo "Oh no, I get it. Maybe it’s just biology, but I like a guy who knows what he’s doing…"
    blo "噢，我懂的。可能算是生理本能吧，但我确实喜欢经验丰富的男人……"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1734
translate chinese bar4_36569605:

    # sky "That ‘stud’ energy? Yeah, I’m with you on that. Mmm, it’s hot."
    sky "那种\"种马\"气场？我完全懂。嗯…确实很诱人。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1736
translate chinese bar4_5a563526:

    # blo "Y-Yeah… And after all that, he still comes back to me. It makes me feel so special."
    blo "是…是啊…而且经历了这些之后，他最终选择回到我身边。这让我觉得自己是特别的。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1740
translate chinese bar4_bc017ec0:

    # "[sky] and [blo] both give me a sneaky, lewd glance…"
    "[sky]和[blo]同时投来暧昧的眼神…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1745
translate chinese bar4_d854cf59:

    # "But neither of these girls are sneaky. They both… {i}fucking noticed{/i} each other's 'sneaky' glance, and now they’re staring at each other blankly."
    "但这俩姑娘压根不会偷偷摸摸。她们直接…{i} 逮到了 {/i}对方“鬼祟”的视线，现在正尴尬地大眼瞪小眼。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1747
translate chinese bar4_eea339d2:

    # sky "Are… you…?"
    sky "难道你…也…？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1749
translate chinese bar4_52c58b8e:

    # blo "I… uhm…"
    blo "我…那个…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1751
translate chinese bar4_b5e3feb2:

    # sky "Have you… had sex… with… *{i}Eh-hem{/i}* Are we both talking about this doofus? This one right here? *{i}Point, point{/i}*"
    sky "你难道…和…{i} 咳咳 {/i}我们说的该不会是同一个笨蛋吧？就这家伙？{i} 指来指去 {/i}"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1752
translate chinese bar4_a92dd758:

    # mc "Hey, I thought we were pretending I wasn’t here."
    mc "喂，不是说好当我不存在吗？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1754
translate chinese bar4_6b6f0316:

    # blo "*{i}Gulp{/i}* I am…"
    blo "{i} 咕噜 {/i}我确实…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1755
translate chinese bar4_eaa23d16:

    # "[sky] shakes her head, lifts her drink and starts to down it in one go."
    "[sky]摇摇头，举起酒杯开始一饮而尽。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1757
translate chinese bar4_d9a4f34f:

    # sky "Aaahhh! Alright, well, I don’t know about you two, but I’m wiped. How about we keep this conversation going at my place?"
    sky "啊——！好吧，不知道你俩怎么想，反正我是累瘫了。要不去我那儿继续聊？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1759
translate chinese bar4_bb3db275:

    # blo "Hmm… Yeah… Yeah!"
    blo "嗯…好啊…好啊！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1760
translate chinese bar4_19b0c51b:

    # "Oh no, what’s happening?!"
    "噢，不会吧，这是什么情况？！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1761
translate chinese bar4_cc5a37d4:

    # "Or maybe, I should be thinking ‘oh yes’, {i}what’s happening!{/i}"
    "或许我该想着\"太棒了\"，{i} 这到底是怎么回事！ {/i}"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1763
translate chinese bar4_0a84d5d0:

    # "Before long, I was whisked away from the bar and into the cool night air, with [sky] linked on one arm, and [blo] latched to the other."
    "没过多久，我就被她们带离酒吧，融进凉爽的夜晚中，[sky]挽着我左臂，[blo]紧紧搂着右边胳膊。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1767
translate chinese bar4_d28581da:

    # "Once we hit [sky]’s apartment, she tossed her bag over a chair and stretched with a satisfied sigh."
    "一进[sky]的公寓，她就把包甩到椅子上，满足地伸了个懒腰。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1773
translate chinese bar4_aea57096:

    # sky "Come on, sit. Get comfortable. I’ve missed this… it’s been too long since I had a night like this."
    sky "来，坐吧。放松点。我一直挺怀念这种氛围的…已经很久没度过这样的夜晚了。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1774
translate chinese bar4_89239590:

    # "I took a seat in the centre, and [sky] flopped onto the couch next to me. She leaned into my side, breast squeezing against my shoulder and her hand casually resting on my thigh."
    "我在沙发中间坐下，[sky]随即瘫倒在我身旁。她靠向我这边，胸部压着我的肩膀，手自然地搭在我大腿上。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1775
translate chinese bar4_594bccce:

    # "[blo] paused for a moment before taking a seat on the other side of me. She carefully watches [sky] and mirrors her actions."
    "[blo]迟疑片刻，最终在我另一侧坐下。她仔细观察着[sky]的动作，然后小心翼翼地模仿起来。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1776
translate chinese bar4_c78b8ff6:

    # mc "I can’t help but notice how you’ve got me surrounded here."
    mc "我不由注意到你把我困在这儿了呢。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1778
translate chinese bar4_90c5ba84:

    # blo "Small world, huh?"
    blo "世界真小啊，对吧？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1780
translate chinese bar4_6d3da9ec:

    # sky "[mc], you really should've mentioned who you were... sleeping with."
    sky "[mc]，你真该早点说明白你在和谁…发生关系。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1781
translate chinese bar4_97f4840c:

    # mc "How was I supposed to know you two were classmates?"
    mc "我哪会知道你俩原来是同学啊？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1783
translate chinese bar4_dc361b93:

    # sky "Heh, and here I thought [blo] was the innocent type? Maybe she’s that ‘quiet’ type everyone always talks about?"
    sky "呵呵，之前还以为[blo]是清纯类型？说不定她就是人们常说的那种\"闷声不响\"的类型呢？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1785
translate chinese bar4_6be4a05a:

    # blo "I-I was totally innocent! Until… I met [mc]…"
    blo "我-我之前真的很单纯的！直到遇见[mc]…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1787
translate chinese bar4_a913c2cd:

    # sky "So, you’re not a virgin?"
    sky "所以你已经不是处女了？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1789
translate chinese bar4_5a9313f0:

    # blo "N-No… It was in the barn, not even in a bedroom. [mc] didn’t hesitate! He pushed me down in the barn and took me right there! It was {i}sooo{/i} hot…"
    blo "不-不是了…就在谷仓里，连卧室都没有。[mc]根本毫不犹豫！他把我按在干草堆上就直接要了我！真的{i} 超级 {/i}刺激…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1790
translate chinese bar4_00bf3a4d:

    # "That’s not quite how I remember it…"
    "我记得的版本好像不太一样…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1792
translate chinese bar4_c2d2c7c2:

    # sky "Heavens above, I would’ve loved to see that. (I can’t believe she lost her virginity before I did!)"
    sky "天哪，我要是能亲眼看到就好了。（真不敢相信她比我先失去童贞！）"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1794
translate chinese bar4_7fd6df45:

    # blo "Y-You would? I’ve always thought it’d be hot to have someone else watch, but… well… no one’s really…"
    blo "真-真的吗？其实我一直觉得被人看着会特别刺激，但是…呃…从来没真的…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1796
translate chinese bar4_fa165c92:

    # sky "Really? That’s interesting… Really interesting…"
    sky "真的？这倒有意思…非常有意思…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1797
translate chinese bar4_8d1908b1:

    # "[sky] shifts closer to [blo] like a cougar stalking her prey."
    "[sky]像盯上猎物的美洲豹般缓缓贴近[blo]。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1799
translate chinese bar4_8f034991:

    # sky "Why don’t you two show me exactly how it went down, right here?"
    sky "不如你俩就在这儿给我原景重现一下？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1801
translate chinese bar4_aaab6e6a:

    # "[blo] glanced at me, her uncertainty flickering in her eyes, and I shrugged."
    "[blo]朝我投来犹豫的眼神，我耸了耸肩。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1805
translate chinese bar4_974ee153:

    # mc "Why the hell not? Want me to fuck you right now, [blo]?"
    mc "有什么不可以的？想让我现在就和你做爱吗，[blo]？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1807
translate chinese bar4_bd655f0d:

    # blo "It’d feel… strange, with an old friend watching, but…"
    blo "被老朋友看着会感觉…有点怪，不过…"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1808
translate chinese bar4_5eb40701:

    # sky "Hey, don’t overthink it. We’re {i}all{/i} friends here—just let it feel natural!"
    sky "别想太多啦。咱们{i} 都是 {/i}朋友——放轻松顺其自然就好！"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1809
translate chinese bar4_a036de00:

    # sky "Now what position was it in?"
    sky "当时是什么姿势来着？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1815
translate chinese bar4_93ae6a32:

    # blo "Uhm, well, I suppose it was bent over like this. Right, [mc]?"
    blo "呃，大概是这样弯腰趴着的姿势。对吧，[mc]？"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1816
translate chinese bar4_330fe0d6:

    # mc "Oh yeah, I’d never forget that fuzzy peach."
    mc "噢当然，我永远忘不了那颗毛茸茸的水蜜桃。"

# game/4.6 - Bar Route.rpy:1817
